{"3753140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BRAMBLEFORT", "steam_appid": 3753140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/4b681ba5e65c045e7ac4ba8c12596e40.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/4b681ba5e65c045e7ac4ba8c12596e40.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BRAMBLEFORT</strong> is a VR survival horror game built around exploration, scavenging, and player-driven problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Location-based damage</strong> — damage is heavily tied to where you hit. Precision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and scavenge</strong> — levels reward players who look carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fixed solutions</strong> — combat and obstacles can be approached in multiple ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light RPG systems</strong> — fine-tune your playstyle. Levels are built to be replayed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/6cef2e8d7b5ba20e69c420382bfc3466.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/6cef2e8d7b5ba20e69c420382bfc3466.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a field operative sent by a classified intelligence agency to investigate a remote island in the Northern Atlantic. You arrive with minimal briefing and inadequate gear. The agency has underestimated the situation. Complete your objectives with what you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/0ad209a99afebe3af20ec1be5d337cdd.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/0ad209a99afebe3af20ec1be5d337cdd.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BRAMBLEFORT</strong> is built exclusively for VR. Every weapon is designed around physical weight and realistic handling. Reloading, aiming, and melee combat require deliberate movement and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of options found in stashes or taken from fallen inhabitants. Weight and size vary significantly. Small knives to 200-kilogram murder tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firearms</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-action revolver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-barreled shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolt-action rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-cranked Gatling gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harpoon gun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throwables</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosives and improvised devices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/110ff65857fde46a0b9e0d6811a28f80.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/110ff65857fde46a0b9e0d6811a28f80.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The island's social hierarchy shapes everything you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coastal villages</strong> — impoverished fishing settlements. Simple huts, basic weapons, medieval in everything but the year.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inland towns</strong> — wealthier, more organized. The further from the coast, the more refined the infrastructure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victorian mansions</strong> — grand estates at the island's center and higher elevations. A different world entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/f2283ed2cd957b71de2c6602a8e3077e.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/f2283ed2cd957b71de2c6602a8e3077e.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built from the ground up for VR. Systems are designed to interact with each other in ways that feel consistent and grounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layered levels</strong> — multiple ways through. Secrets and shortcuts reward exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive NPCs</strong> — inhabitants respond dynamically to environment changes, player actions, and violence around them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct interaction</strong> — pick up and manipulate objects with your hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Systems that talk to each other</strong> — stealth, combat, and environment are connected.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/4b681ba5e65c045e7ac4ba8c12596e40.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/4b681ba5e65c045e7ac4ba8c12596e40.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BRAMBLEFORT</strong> is a VR survival horror game built around exploration, scavenging, and player-driven problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Location-based damage</strong> — damage is heavily tied to where you hit. Precision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and scavenge</strong> — levels reward players who look carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fixed solutions</strong> — combat and obstacles can be approached in multiple ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light RPG systems</strong> — fine-tune your playstyle. Levels are built to be replayed.</p></li