 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firearms</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-action revolver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-barreled shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolt-action rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-cranked Gatling gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harpoon gun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throwables</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosives and improvised devices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/110ff65857fde46a0b9e0d6811a28f80.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/110ff65857fde46a0b9e0d6811a28f80.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The island's social hierarchy shapes everything you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coastal villages</strong> — impoverished fishing settlements. Simple huts, basic weapons, medieval in everything but the year.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inland towns</strong> — wealthier, more organized. The further from the coast, the more refined the infrastructure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victorian mansions</strong> — grand estates at the island's center and higher elevations. A different world entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras/f2283ed2cd957b71de2c6602a8e3077e.avif?t=1782372795\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/extras_big/f2283ed2cd957b71de2c6602a8e3077e.webp?t=1782372795 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built from the ground up for VR. Systems are designed to interact with each other in ways that feel consistent and grounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layered levels</strong> — multiple ways through. Secrets and shortcuts reward exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive NPCs</strong> — inhabitants respond dynamically to environment changes, player actions, and violence around them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct interaction</strong> — pick up and manipulate objects with your hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Systems that talk to each other</strong> — stealth, combat, and environment are connected.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "BRAMBLEFORT is a VR survival horror game built for exploration, immersion, and weighty combat. Journey through a desolate North Atlantic island, where rotting huts gradually give way to towering Victorian mansions as you make your way toward its center.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/46d1f3959d29dc4db1ec7da76bf17cb1f4a4429a/header.jpg?t=1782372795", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753140/0eaf19d09c1f19fa3688934589b18db1e1d15b03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178237